            "text": "<p>Supplied with a reliable MX 24V 4.0Ah battery and a 1 hour fast charger. Every MX 24V 4.0Ah battery and charger is fully compatible with the LawnMaster MX 24V cordless range, including lawnmowers, hedge trimmers, grass trimmers, chainsaws and leaf blowers.</p>",
